title: Vendor
---
<<declare $metVendor = false>>
<<if $metVendor>>
    Merchant: Back again? Care to see my wares?
<<else>>
    Merchant: Welcome, traveler. Care to see my wares?
    <<set $metVendor = true>>
<<endif>>
-> Browse wares
    <<open_shop>>
-> {hero_line("enchanter.decline", "Not now")} #decline
    Player: Not now
===